meta {
  name: health
  seq: 2
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Liveness and readiness.

  `live` checks nothing but the process, deliberately: a liveness probe that fails on a database
  blip gets every pod killed and restarted, turning a recoverable outage into a total one.
  `ready` pings the database and answers 503 when it cannot serve, which removes the instance
  from the load balancer without killing it.

  Mounted before the rate limiter, so a probe firing every few seconds cannot throttle itself.
}
